      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Williamsport%2C_Maryland",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Back in 1755, the area that became Williamsport served as a key supply depot for Braddock’s march toward French Fort Duquesne.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
